BIN&nbsp- says the director has to stand up to the president.]  [Representative Jane HARMAN&nbsp- cites the need to move faster.]  [Senator Pat ROBERTS&nbsp- backs Goss.]", "segment_duration": 260, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762115, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762114, "segment_id": "6F2rDPCzLT", "segment_broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "segment_title": "Terrorism / Arrest", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas, Brian Ross)  The arrest of a Pakistani man who took pictures of financial centers in several cities as well as a dam outside Austin discussed; scenes shown of the man.", "segment_duration": 70, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762116, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762114, "segment_id": "dney190gTY", "segment_broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "segment_title": "Terrorism / Las Vegas, Nevada", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Report introduced.   (Washington: Pierre Thomas)  The 2002 discovery of two videotapes of possible Al Qaeda members casing casinos in Las Vegas examined; details given about the link of five September 11 hijackers to Las Vegas & of concerns the city covered up a terrorist threat.  [Consultant Jack CLOONAN&#134;- says Las Vegas is a prime target.]  [Former federal prosecutor Richard CONVERTINO&#134;- explains the liability issue on the videotapes.]  [Mayor Oscar GOODMAN&#134;- downplays the warnings.]", "segment_duration": 110, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63380.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762117, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762114, "segment_id": "5xGOuEDQfB", "segment_broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "segment_title": "Iraq / Al-Sadr Revolt / Najaf", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Report introduced.   (Baghdad: Mike von Fremd)  The sixth day of fighting in Najaf, Iraq, between the US military & Iraqi security forces & the militias of Shiite cleric Muqtada al-Sadr featured; scenes shown of US vehicles, helicopter fire, the city cemetery & the holy shrine where wounded are treated.   (Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Estimates of militant casualties noted.", "segment_duration": 110, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63490.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762118, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "itlJjrXXGL", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network